      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Manus"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How I Use AI in Project Management:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Thought Partner for Deep Exploration – Challenge assumptions and refine strategic thinking."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Idea Development & Synthesis – Connect insights across disciplines and simplify complexity."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Strategy & Decision-Making Support – Map trade-offs, assess risks, and anticipate second-order effects."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Creative & Aesthetic Exploration – Rapidly iterate and refine ideas by generating and evaluating visual designs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Personal Knowledge Management – Organize, synthesize, and track project materials, notes, files, client feedback, milestones, and communications."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. Technical Problem-Solving (Rubber Ducky) – Debug complex coding issues and design system architectures informed by project goals, files, and context."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "My goal is to collaborate with Manus as a precision instrument—one that enhances clarity, efficiency, and strategic insight without sacrificing creativity."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I was also considering applying for YC but the deadline has passed. They're still accepting applications until March 12th (four days from now), and I'm wondering if I should just go for it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm attaching some screenshots of the progress we've made thus far, for context. It's hard to illustrate every corner of it for you but I hope this gives you an idea of where we are in terms of development progress."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}